{"id":"n71879-1-10","stage":4,"title":"의사소통 · 沟通","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71879-1-10-1","ko":"김 부장님과는 의사소통이 전혀 되질 않네요.","zh":"和金部长完全沟通不了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"부장님과는","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부장님과는","audio":"/audio/be119cdb1378f22cae34.mp3"}},{"text":"의사소통이","meaning":"沟通，沟通思想","explanation":"의사소통：沟通，沟通思想；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의사소통","audio":"/audio/3002fee3c5565982de2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71879","senseId":"1","lemma":"의사소통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의사소통이","audio":"/audio/1a94c625ec55acd00103.mp3"}},{"text":"전혀","meaning":"全然","explanation":"전혀：全然","readings":[{"term":"전혀","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75769","senseId":"1","lemma":"전혀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전혀","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3"}},{"text":"되질","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되질","audio":"/audio/850f5ab1c2406586cf37.mp3"}},{"text":"않네요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네요","audio":"/audio/042cabd29a00026f1220.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"3002fee3c5565982","term":"의사소통","zh":"沟通，沟通思想","audio":"/audio/3002fee3c5565982de2c.mp3","entryId":"71879","definition":"互相交流想法或语言等。","pronunciation":["의ː사소통"]},{"id":"34ef0e2fe1bc197f","term":"전혀","zh":"全然","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3","entryId":"75769","definition":"根本；或完全。","pronunciation":["전혀"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/20888b946699178d4110.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71879-1-10-2","ko":"맞아. 나도 답답하기는 마찬가지야.","zh":"是啊，我也一样觉得憋闷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"답답하기는","meaning":"烦闷，堵得慌，发闷","explanation":"답답하다：烦闷，堵得慌，发闷；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"답답하다","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49437","senseId":"1","lemma":"답답하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답답하기는","audio":"/audio/bb930b2d9316773c5602.mp3"}},{"text":"마찬가지야.","meaning":"相同，一样","explanation":"마찬가지：相同，一样；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"마찬가지","audio":"/audio/c61fbe207e8136d7dc53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28814","senseId":"1","lemma":"마찬가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마찬가지야","audio":"/audio/4791bb30fba3bbb066ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"303de431f55bd88a","term":"답답하다","zh":"烦闷，堵得慌，发闷","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3","entryId":"49437","definition":"像要窒息或难以呼吸。","pronunciation":["답따파다"]},{"id":"c61fbe207e8136d7","term":"마찬가지","zh":"相同，一样","audio":"/audio/c61fbe207e8136d7dc53.mp3","entryId":"28814","definition":"两个以上物体的形状或事情的状况没有差异。","pronunciation":["마찬가지"]}],"audio":"/audio/8da20afff8b164d374a9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.871,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71879","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["和金部长完全沟通不了。","是啊，我也一样觉得憋闷。","我打算学习阿筝呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["和金部长完全沟通不了。","是啊，我也一样觉得憋闷。","我打算学习阿筝呢。"],"answer":1}]}
